  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USE OF THE FUND FOR THE PROTECTION OF CULTURAL PROPERTY IN THE EVENT O</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Fund for the Protection of Cultural Property in the event of Armed Conflict is to provide financial or other assistance in support of preparatory or other measures to be taken in principle in peacetime, as well as in relation to emergency, provisional or other measures to be taken in order to protect cultural property in principle during periods of armed conflict or of immediate recovery in principle after the end of hostilities.</narrative>
  </description>
